1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:42,300
[Episode 22]

10
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:46,330
At that time, I was barely conscious.

11
00:01:47,510 --> 00:01:48,930
I could only entrust
this great undertaking

12
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:50,740
to you and Jiu Wu.

13
00:01:52,230 --> 00:01:52,930
You two

14
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:57,460
truly united the Three Sects.

15
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,660
I am truly gratified.

16
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,690
Senior.

17
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:10,780
Senior,

18
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,450
is it because

19
00:02:12,870 --> 00:02:14,820
I didn't persuade Aunt Jiu Jiu to come

20
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:15,980
that Uncle Jiu Wu...

21
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,780
I'm sorry.

22
00:02:19,190 --> 00:02:20,290
It's not your fault.

23
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,380
Mentor was worried about us,

24
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:27,690
so he had Uncle Jiu Wu look after us.

25
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,540
You can never truly know
someone's heart.

26
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,980
Uncle Jiu Wu...

27
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,610
I'll play weiqi with you

28
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,340
in the next life.

29
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:11,060
You promised me you'd come back.

30
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,610
Liar.

31
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,660
I was the one supposed to go.

32
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,570
The one who should have died was me.

33
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,100
Why you?

34
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:34,730
Get up.

35
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:37,540
Get up!

36
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:40,010
I am deeply ashamed.

37
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,540
The pearl of our sect

38
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,980
can actually be used like this.

39
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,010
Changgeng,

40
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,780
what spell did you just use?

41
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:51,220
That's one of my Montage Art tricks.

42
00:03:51,310 --> 00:03:52,170
It's called

43
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,290
the CAG special effect.

44
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,170
It can add new content at will

45
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:57,940
in this pearl image,

46
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,610
turning it into an illusion.

47
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,540
Montage...

48
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,060
Montage...

49
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,290
CAG?

50
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:04,540
An illusion?

51
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,260
The world's magic

52
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,940
is truly ever-changing.

53
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,450
I am again enlightened.

54
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,700
Changgeng,

55
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,100
your mastery is so profound.

56
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,290
Why don't you do it yourself?

57
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:21,930
Why use my hands for this illusion?

58
00:04:22,310 --> 00:04:25,980
I'm a carefree wandering immortal,

59
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,730
dragged into this mess for no reason,

60
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:29,490
already entangled in too much karma.

61
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:31,610
The credit for resolving the crisis
of the Three Sects

62
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,370
shall go to you.

63
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,050
Indifferent to fame and fortune,

64
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:36,980
and of remarkable attainment.

65
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,730
I've learned much today.

66
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,930
Then I must trouble you as well.

67
00:04:41,750 --> 00:04:42,850
As you've seen for yourself,

68
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:45,050
this has nothing to do with our sect.

69
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:47,290
It's that Westdawn
causing all the trouble.

70
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:52,050
Please pass word to your sect's sage.

71
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,730
Of course, of course.

72
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:54,490
Many thanks.

73
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,020
Hermit,

74
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,050
what of the item I entrusted to you?

75
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,780
I'm ashamed.

76
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:10,780
I couldn't tell what treasure it was,

77
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:12,930
but it drew hordes
of demons from all around.

78
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,930
They swarmed me.

79
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,370
I couldn't hold them off alone.

80
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,900
What do you mean?

81
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,580
You didn't lose it, did you?

82
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,100
Why didn't you lose yourself too?

83
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,370
I've had it.

84
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:27,100
I've wronged you, Changgeng.

85
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,170
I willingly accept punishment.

86
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:29,580
Forget about punishment.

87
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,980
What good is punishing you now?

88
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,100
You lost his stuff.

89
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,410
Pay 50,000 spirit stones.

90
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:34,220
How much?

91
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,220
Or give me that pearl instead.

92
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,290
Hermit, do not blame yourself.

93
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,170
The pearl.

94
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:39,780
I have

95
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,730
foreseen this.

96
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:44,810
To gain, there must be loss.

97
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:46,980
Since loss is inevitable,

98
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:49,540
why not turn this loss to advantage?

99
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,490
Westdawn Sect wants
the Pregenesis Sword.

100
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,930
That's why they attacked
Ascendance Sect.

101
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,730
But little do they know

102
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,700
that I only have one fragment.

103
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:02,490
So, they must seek
the other two fragments.

104
00:06:03,190 --> 00:06:04,370
Thus...

105
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:06,020
We can surely lure them out.

106
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,700
Wait.

107
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,930
Since you want to discard it,

108
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:13,930
why make me guard it?

109
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,730
How did you even become an immortal?

110
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:16,900
If we leave it for someone to take,

111
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,370
isn't that obviously a trap?

112
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,930
Your guarding it makes
the ruse more real.

113
00:06:21,950 --> 00:06:22,730
I'm speechless.

114
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,220
It really is.

115
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,290
The traitor Kuai Si said

116
00:06:26,310 --> 00:06:28,540
that Westdawn Sect is set up
in the East Sea.

117
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,780
They'll soon trigger
the Great Tribulation.

118
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,250
We must lure them out asap.

119
00:06:32,270 --> 00:06:33,340
Then what are we waiting for?

120
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,490
Let's charge into the East Sea now.

121
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,580
No, no.

122
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:38,490
The East Sea is
the Dragon Clan's territory.

123
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,900
If you just storm in there,

124
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,700
it'll surely spark a human-dragon war.

125
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,460
That would make things far worse.

126
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,490
Then what do you suggest?

127
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,140
Ascendance Sect has long had ties
with the Dragon Palace.

128
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,930
We need only send a small team inside

129
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,370
to root out the hidden mastermind.

130
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,810
Then, we can avert
the Great Tribulation.

131
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,100
You're humans.

132
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,050
Will they let you enter

133
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,540
without reason?

134
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,290
Don't worry.

135
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,980
I still hold a hidden trump card.

136
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:08,220
Greetings, Grandlord.

137
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,930
The Sea Deity Sect

138
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:14,460
is vast in territory,
with countless disciples,

139
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:17,730
but I roam afar, hard to govern.

140
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:21,050
To ensure the Sea Deity Sect
endures forever,

141
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:22,340
today,

142
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:24,370
I formally declare

143
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:25,250
the appointment

144
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:28,780
of Ao Yi, Second Prince of the East Sea,

145
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:30,580
as the Second Grandlord

146
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,370
and Azure Protector

147
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,020
to act as Grandlord.

148
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:37,540
I...

149
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,370
How could I deserve this?

150
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:40,370
No need to refuse.

151
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,850
I saw you turn into a golden dragon,

152
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:53,140
fight off the demons,

153
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:56,250
and save everyone.

154
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:58,780
You are already a great hero.

155
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:03,780
I...

156
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,580
Am I already a great hero?

157
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:07,700
I know

158
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,730
you've always dreamed of leading

159
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,850
the Dragon Clan back to glory.

160
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:17,460
That's right.

161
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,220
Then, now

162
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,730
is the time.

163
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:21,900
You can return to the Dragon Palace

164
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,020
as the Second Grandlord

165
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,370
and the Azure Protector.

166
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:29,020
Then, your father and brother

167
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:31,540
will see how strong you've grown

168
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:35,180
after what you've been through.

169
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,940
Yes, Grandlord.

170
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,420
This time,

171
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:42,370
I will crush Westdawn Sect's plot

172
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:44,130
to pieces.

173
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,250
As expected of Changgeng.

174
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,300
You're nothing like what I heard.

175
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,460
You heard about me?

176
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:54,730
What did you hear about me?

177
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,010
I heard it from my sister.

178
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,060
She said you dodge trouble when you can

179
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,100
and are selfish, given to despair,

180
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,180
wallow in self-pity,

181
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:02,890
and...

182
00:09:03,750 --> 00:09:05,060
You know what I mean.

183
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,370
But seeing you today,

184
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:10,180
you truly have a heroic air.

185
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,890
My sister's view is too shallow.

186
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,490
You're right.

187
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:19,130
The old Changgeng

188
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,490
would never have formulated

189
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,100
a plan to strike first.

190
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,530
I used to think

191
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:27,460
that everything was under my control

192
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:29,250
and that everything in this world

193
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,420
would unfold as I envisioned.

194
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,730
But I was wrong.

195
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,530
My avoidance

196
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,340
only let those demons run wilder,

197
00:09:42,870 --> 00:09:45,340
causing irreparable harm.

198
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,530
From this day forward,

199
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:50,890
I will no longer hide.

200
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,460
Even if the Great Tribulation arrives,

201
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,700
I will also give it a try.

202
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:58,490
I will show Fate

203
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,490
that the Great Tribulation

204
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,770
does not come and go as it pleases.

205
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,420
Mentor,

206
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,370
sorry

207
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:07,650
about the Transformation Art.

208
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,730
You've worked so hard.

209
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,890
Rest for a while.

210
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:19,420
My heart is now empty.

211
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,770
Nothing left at all.

212
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,820
Sit with me for a while.

213
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:33,650
Not yet.

214
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:38,300
The sect must escort
the Second Prince back.

215
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:40,850
The Second Prince named me

216
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,770
to accompany him.

217
00:11:49,550 --> 00:11:51,580
I never knew you were this busy.

218
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:53,300
No, wait.

219
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,730
You were busy before too,

220
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,100
but I never knew
what kept you so occupied.

221
00:12:02,910 --> 00:12:03,700
Go on.

222
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,100
After all, I used to be alone

223
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:12,130
in Jade Division.

224
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:16,980
I can endure this loneliness.

225
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:20,180
Go on.

226
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,340
This jade talisman had
Kuai Si's demonic arts.

227
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:46,850
Kuai Si is dead.

228
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:48,820
So, the demonic arts are dispelled.

229
00:12:54,600 --> 00:13:00,140
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

230
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:07,740
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

231
00:13:09,250 --> 00:13:15,180
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

232
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:22,510
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

233
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:30,190
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

234
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,340
Junior Qi Yuan,

235
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,820
since I left without saying goodbye,

236
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:35,340
it's been many years.

237
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,980
Is all well in Jade Division?

238
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:40,730
Mentor and I are in Kuru Land,

239
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,980
seeking herbs
to restore your foundation.

240
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:45,980
Mortals always envy us cultivators

241
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,650
for having a path to eternal life.

242
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:49,650
A thousand years pass in a blink for us.

243
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:51,890
But they do not know this:

244
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,130
Even parted mortals
feel each day is a year.

245
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:57,220
How can separated cultivators

246
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:01,130
bear a thousand years of longing?

247
00:14:01,870 --> 00:14:03,610
So what if we have magic power?

248
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,580
So what if we can live long?

249
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:08,490
Sometimes, I think

250
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:10,850
it's fine to trade
for a few decades together

251
00:14:10,870 --> 00:14:11,370
Set out.

252
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:13,530
with these cultivation bodies

253
00:14:14,030 --> 00:14:15,010
of ours.

254
00:14:15,010 --> 00:14:16,790
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

255
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:17,940
Whenever I think of this,

256
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:20,010
I lie awake at night.

257
00:14:21,390 --> 00:14:22,250
But then I think

258
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:24,650
once I've restored your foundation,

259
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:27,890
we can be together for eons.

260
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,820
Wouldn't that be even more beautiful?

261
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:33,420
Kuru Land is perilous,

262
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:36,490
yet some corners are truly breathtaking.

263
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:39,530
At times, I think

264
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:40,770
that if we both ascended,

265
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,650
I'd surely bring you here,

266
00:14:42,670 --> 00:14:43,890
and we'd be
wandering immortals together.

267
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,340
Could such a day come?

268
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:49,980
Junior,

269
00:14:50,790 --> 00:14:52,010
I will surely return.

270
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:55,420
However long it'll take,

271
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:57,420
I'll return someday.

272
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,060
So,

273
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,490
you must stay alive

274
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:01,650
and wait for me.

275
00:15:03,270 --> 00:15:04,370
If you dare lose heart

276
00:15:04,390 --> 00:15:05,770
and abandon this cultivation path,

277
00:15:06,750 --> 00:15:08,180
I will not forgive you.

278
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,610
Senior,

279
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:17,180
I'll remember you.

280
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:20,340
You'll always be in my heart.

281
00:15:21,170 --> 00:15:28,490
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

282
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:35,610
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

283
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:42,980
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

284
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:45,970
♪Past fragments♪

285
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:50,870
♪Vanish into night♪

286
00:15:50,870 --> 00:15:53,060
[Jade Division]

287
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,420
My Blood Gnats

288
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:29,530
have been completely wiped out?

289
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,650
Defeated Wen Jing,

290
00:16:32,790 --> 00:16:34,530
do you admit your guilt?

291
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,700
I'm Wen Jing.

292
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,610
Greetings, Two Saints of Westdawn.

293
00:16:37,670 --> 00:16:39,340
[Jieyin, Saint of Westdawn Sect]
You've failed to seize...

294
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,730
[Zhunti, Saint of Westdawn Sect]
The Pregenesis Sword.

295
00:16:40,910 --> 00:16:41,850
Sorry for being incompetent.

296
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,530
Incompetent?

297
00:16:45,150 --> 00:16:48,130
The army was dispatched,
yet all efforts were in vain.

298
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,340
You have sabotaged
our sect's grand plan.

299
00:16:50,390 --> 00:16:51,980
What punishment do you deserve?

300
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,650
I failed in proper planning.

301
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:55,180
I'm unforgivable!

302
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,010
Yet Ascendance Sect was gravely wounded.

303
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:59,370
Seizing and Human Sects
became sworn foes.

304
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,060
I think...

305
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:00,980
Foolish!

306
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,100
Arrogant!

307
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:12,810
You think your petty puppetry spell

308
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:15,290
can fool Voidcity?

309
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:18,220
We covered for you,

310
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,620
yet you exposed yourself.

311
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:25,330
Voidcity has likely noticed you.

312
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,380
Our sect now faces exposure.

313
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:30,860
Should the Three Sects investigate,

314
00:17:31,310 --> 00:17:33,140
our sect may not withstand it.

315
00:17:33,790 --> 00:17:35,050
Now, we can only

316
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:39,220
kill the demons to prove our innocence.

317
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:39,900
No, no!

318
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,010
Please, no!

319
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,180
No!

320
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:45,090
I'm begging you.

321
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:47,180
I committed the guilt

322
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:49,220
and wrongs alone.

323
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:50,810
Should punishment come,

324
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,490
I will bear it all.

325
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,940
I beg you to grant this.

326
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:57,250
Too late.

327
00:17:59,350 --> 00:18:01,490
I've already destroyed three-tenths

328
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,660
of your clan left in the Blood Sea.

329
00:18:04,830 --> 00:18:06,140
I also destroyed

330
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,570
another three-tenths.

331
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,700
The Two Saints
of Westdawn punish the wicked

332
00:18:11,030 --> 00:18:14,180
to avenge the Ascendance Sect.

333
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,730
Thus,

334
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:19,860
the Three Sects won't doubt us.

335
00:18:20,550 --> 00:18:22,660
The fate of the remaining

336
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:24,660
four-tenths of your clan

337
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:28,940
depends on your future conduct.

338
00:18:29,790 --> 00:18:31,140
You must understand

339
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,730
that all this karma

340
00:18:34,350 --> 00:18:38,090
stems from your crushing defeat today.

341
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:44,700
Thanks

342
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:48,770
for your grace.

343
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,980
I will not disappoint you again.

344
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:55,290
Go to the East Sea at once.

345
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:57,140
Meet Jin Chan there.

346
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:00,380
Jin Chan has the Pregenesis Sword.

347
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:02,250
The Eye of the East Sea

348
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:05,010
will open soon.

349
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:12,900
[When the demons attacked
Ascendance Sect.]

350
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:01,620
Lie down.

351
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,250
A python swallowed you.

352
00:20:06,590 --> 00:20:08,090
You were nearly destroyed.

353
00:20:09,030 --> 00:20:09,660
Luckily,

354
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:11,900
you met me.

355
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,290
You cannot speak

356
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,330
and have no memory.

357
00:20:30,070 --> 00:20:32,420
When I found you, you were barely alive.

358
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,460
From now on,

359
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,660
we'll call you Cansheng.

360
00:20:44,110 --> 00:20:45,010
Who are you?

361
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,290
The sea of suffering is endless.

362
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,250
Turn back, and you'll find the shore.

363
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,570
You lost the Pregenesis Sword?

364
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,290
The situation was critical.

365
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:09,220
Only the Sword fragment could bait them.

366
00:21:09,270 --> 00:21:10,220
It was our only way to survive.

367
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,570
You gave me your word

368
00:21:11,640 --> 00:21:13,380
that your fragment would be safe.

369
00:21:13,550 --> 00:21:15,290
They came for the Sword.

370
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,570
If all three fragments were
in the Celestial Court,

371
00:21:17,790 --> 00:21:19,290
the Westdawn Sect would attack directly.

372
00:21:19,310 --> 00:21:21,090
The aftermath would be unimaginable.

373
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:27,490
That's not wrong.

374
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,570
We barely have forces.

375
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:31,220
We couldn't hold it.

376
00:21:35,270 --> 00:21:36,290
Thanks for the warning.

377
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:37,730
I'll hide

378
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,900
my fragment carefully.

379
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:44,660
Actually,

380
00:21:45,270 --> 00:21:48,660
I've come for your fragment.

381
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,660
Ascendance Sect had this battle

382
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,620
because we were

383
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:55,490
too conservative in strategy.

384
00:21:55,550 --> 00:21:56,620
Even the strongest defense

385
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:58,940
can't hold against repeated attacks.

386
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,180
That's true.

387
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:04,940
Since the enemy openly aims
for the Sword,

388
00:22:05,070 --> 00:22:07,290
we should turn defense into offense

389
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:08,490
and end this threat for good.

390
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:14,490
So, you deliberately let the Demon Clan

391
00:22:15,030 --> 00:22:16,660
take the Sword fragment.

392
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,420
Though Westdawn Sect hasn't surfaced,

393
00:22:18,510 --> 00:22:20,090
they must have already slipped
into the Dragon Palace.

394
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:22,180
This is our only chance
to flush them out.

395
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:24,620
Once Westdawn Sect sees that fragment,

396
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:25,180
they will...

397
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,730
They'll seek out the other fragments.

398
00:22:27,070 --> 00:22:28,010
Your Majesty, you're wise.

399
00:22:28,030 --> 00:22:29,700
I happen to have a fragment.

400
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:30,570
How wise of you.

401
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:32,090
I can lure them out,

402
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,570
reveal their true, ugly faces,

403
00:22:33,590 --> 00:22:34,860
and catch them all in one sweep.

404
00:22:35,030 --> 00:22:35,980
Exactly.

405
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,900
You want me to give you the fragment?

406
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,380
The Sword has three fragments.

407
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:46,900
Even if the Westdawn Sect
seizes two fragments,

408
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:47,860
they still can't

409
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,730
unlock its original power

410
00:22:49,750 --> 00:22:51,330
to open the Eye of the East Sea.

411
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:52,090
Therefore,

412
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:54,140
as long as Fairy Yunxiao's fragment
is safe,

413
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,570
risking my fragment is acceptable.

414
00:22:56,590 --> 00:22:57,810
You are right.

415
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:02,050
Still, it's a little risky.

416
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,460
I will devise a solid plan.

417
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:05,250
And I will ensure everything

418
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,490
goes exactly according to plan.

419
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,180
This plan hardly seems your doing.

420
00:23:09,310 --> 00:23:10,700
Aren't you known for playing it safe?

421
00:23:12,510 --> 00:23:13,530
I just think

422
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:15,180
that one

423
00:23:15,510 --> 00:23:17,730
should sometimes try

424
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:19,530
something a bit risky.

425
00:23:20,420 --> 00:23:23,260
[Li Changshou]

426
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,700
Connect! Connect!

427
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,700
This is so serious.

428
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:28,460
Connect!

429
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:30,180
Should we bring Fairy Yunxiao in

430
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:30,940
to help us out?

431
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:31,660
No.

432
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:32,660
We're already risking

433
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:34,490
two fragments.

434
00:23:34,510 --> 00:23:36,050
We must not involve her further.

435
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:39,770
We even need to control her whereabouts

436
00:23:40,030 --> 00:23:41,330
to keep her from showing up.

437
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,730
Connect!

438
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:43,980
[Fairy Yunxiao]
Connect!

439
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,490
That's Fairy Yunxiao.

440
00:23:45,550 --> 00:23:46,860
She appears and vanishes
without a trace.

441
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:48,730
Even Heavenreach Master

442
00:23:48,750 --> 00:23:50,860
can't find her.

443
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:54,700
You used to find her
all the time, right?

444
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,860
Now that you mention it,

445
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:02,250
every time she came to me before,

446
00:24:02,270 --> 00:24:04,090
it was her Resonance that summoned me.

447
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:06,330
I've never actively gone
looking for her.

448
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:13,620
Maybe she's left some Resonance

449
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,900
for you in some remote corner?

450
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,490
I don't think so.

451
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:21,250
But

452
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,250
that's just as well.

453
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:26,250
If we can't find her, we'll avoid her.

454
00:24:26,590 --> 00:24:27,860
It'll have the same effect.

455
00:24:28,790 --> 00:24:30,530
So, you're planning

456
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:32,220
to never see her again?

457
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:39,420
Between you and Fairy Yunxiao,

458
00:24:40,070 --> 00:24:41,090
what happened?

459
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:43,900
Nothing.

460
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:48,770
During the crisis at Ascendance Sect,

461
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:51,380
Fairy Yunxiao stormed
my Hall of Soaring Heaven.

462
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:57,660
She summoned the Grand Mage of Voidcity.

463
00:24:59,590 --> 00:25:00,380
She said

464
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:03,140
she won't contact you anymore.

465
00:25:16,070 --> 00:25:16,860
So be it.

466
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,490
With her out of the way,

467
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,050
we can now carry out

468
00:25:20,070 --> 00:25:21,330
our East Sea plan.

469
00:25:24,550 --> 00:25:25,570
You two argued.

470
00:25:26,510 --> 00:25:28,700
Fairy Yunxiao is
such an important person.

471
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:29,330
I...

472
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:30,770
How could a lowly disciple like me

473
00:25:30,790 --> 00:25:32,380
ever rein her in?

474
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:34,570
I simply want her to be free,

475
00:25:34,590 --> 00:25:36,010
far from all turmoil.

476
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,570
That would satisfy me.

477
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:41,660
Your Majesty, may I speak?

478
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,250
I have another request.

479
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:46,380
This East Sea plan

480
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:48,290
will inevitably clash
with Westdawn Sect.

481
00:25:48,310 --> 00:25:49,620
I need many more weapons
and instruments.

482
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,180
None.

483
00:25:51,070 --> 00:25:51,860
I haven't even finished.

484
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,330
How would you know there aren't any?

485
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:54,460
Really, there's none.

486
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,570
The Celestial Court is vast.

487
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,860
There must be some instruments.

488
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:58,980
You're being so stingy!

489
00:25:59,000 --> 00:25:59,490
Hand them over!

490
00:25:59,510 --> 00:26:00,730
There were some before.

491
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:01,700
Now, they're gone.

492
00:26:03,110 --> 00:26:04,620
What do you mean?

493
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:05,330
That's impossible.

494
00:26:05,350 --> 00:26:06,460
You must have some.

495
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:07,860
Why would I lie?

496
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,810
Didn't Fairy Yunxiao come by once?

497
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:11,290
So what if she came by?

498
00:26:11,310 --> 00:26:12,700
The Court's weapons
and magic instruments

499
00:26:12,830 --> 00:26:13,900
were all taken.

500
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,090
All taken?

501
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:15,660
Yeah.

502
00:26:17,790 --> 00:26:18,620
Take what?

503
00:26:19,030 --> 00:26:20,090
Who's trying to take things again?

504
00:26:22,110 --> 00:26:25,050
Only one way in or out
of the Dragon Palace.

505
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:26,900
If a fire broke out,

506
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:28,010
we'd be trapped.

507
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:29,220
You fool.

508
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:31,180
The Dragon Palace is all water.

509
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:32,810
How could there be a fire?

510
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:33,810
That's true.

511
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:36,460
[Token]
It's all part of His Majesty's plan.

512
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:37,860
Without the Dragon Gate Token,

513
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:40,090
no one can invade our East Sea.

514
00:26:40,310 --> 00:26:42,220
Who'd dare attack the East Sea?

515
00:26:42,550 --> 00:26:43,290
Tell me.

516
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:44,980
We'll go report

517
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:46,530
the Little Prince's return.

518
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:47,490
If His Majesty is pleased,

519
00:26:47,510 --> 00:26:49,090
might he grant us a reward?

520
00:26:49,110 --> 00:26:49,700
Maybe.

521
00:26:52,100 --> 00:26:53,340
[Token]

522
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:56,090
Alright.

523
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:57,980
Drink.

524
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:01,180
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

525
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:01,900
You two.

526
00:27:02,350 --> 00:27:02,940
Turtle.

527
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:03,490
Your Majesty.

528
00:27:03,510 --> 00:27:04,570
Perfect timing. Come, come.

529
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,770
Drink with me.

530
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:06,700
I'll pass for now.

531
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,730
Urgent report, Your Majesty!

532
00:27:07,750 --> 00:27:09,290
The Second Prince is back.

533
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,530
Second Prince?

534
00:27:11,070 --> 00:27:12,220
What's this "second"?

535
00:27:13,270 --> 00:27:14,250
How many sons do I have?

536
00:27:14,270 --> 00:27:16,460
Your Majesty, your second son, Ao Yi.

537
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,490
He's back.

538
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:24,700
Exactly.

539
00:27:26,510 --> 00:27:27,090
Ao Yi?

540
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:28,050
Yes, yes!

541
00:27:29,350 --> 00:27:31,810
No, he barely left.

542
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:34,220
So, he couldn't handle it outside

543
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:35,730
and came back?

544
00:27:35,750 --> 00:27:36,730
Yes.

545
00:27:37,110 --> 00:27:38,700
It looks like Yi

546
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:41,490
still hasn't grown up.

547
00:27:42,110 --> 00:27:43,250
Your Majesty!

548
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,940
Do you all know what day it is?

549
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:51,180
The Second Prince is coming back.

550
00:27:51,590 --> 00:27:52,730
It's a joyful day, a good thing.

551
00:27:52,750 --> 00:27:53,620
So cheer up, everyone.

552
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,730
Smile, smile!

553
00:27:54,750 --> 00:27:55,620
When you play later,

554
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,700
give it your all.

555
00:27:56,750 --> 00:27:58,900
Make my little brother happy.

556
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:02,660
Father.

557
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,940
The band is all ready.

558
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:09,090
The Little Prince is young, after all.

559
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:11,770
It's his first time out.
Setbacks are inevitable.

560
00:28:12,270 --> 00:28:14,900
A little dragon, first time out.

561
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,290
What majesty could he have?

562
00:28:16,310 --> 00:28:17,700
Back when I was out there,

563
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,860
I endured so many hardships.

564
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:20,570
Father.

565
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:22,700
Things are not like your time anymore.

566
00:28:22,880 --> 00:28:25,250
No matter how much he suffered outside,

567
00:28:25,510 --> 00:28:26,900
as long as he comes back home,

568
00:28:26,920 --> 00:28:28,290
we'll shower him with love.

569
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:30,220
He's our little treasure, after all.

570
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:31,290
Little treasure.

571
00:28:33,030 --> 00:28:34,620
The little treasure's here.

572
00:28:37,350 --> 00:28:38,900
He's here! Play the music!

573
